                            Flagship Store • Sài Gòn
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="absolute bottom-4 right-4 bg-surface/90 backdrop-blur-md px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-sm">
                        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-tertiary"></span>
                        <span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface font-medium">Đang mở cửa • 07:30 – 21:30</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="p-space-lg space-y-space-md">
                    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start justify-between gap-space-sm">
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Flagship Đồng Khởi</h3>
                            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant flex items-center gap-1.5 mt-1">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-primary">location_on</span>
                                98 Đồng Khởi, Phường Bến Nghé, Quận 1, TP. Hồ Chí Minh
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-surface-container hover:bg-secondary-container transition-colors text-primary font-label-lg text-label-lg shrink-0" href="tel:02838225599">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">call</span>
                            (028) 3822 5599
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Amenities -->
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-space-sm pt-space-xs">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant font-body-sm text-body-sm">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-tertiary">local_parking</span>
                            <span>Có chỗ đỗ xe hơi</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant font-body-sm text-body-sm">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-tertiary">local_cafe</span>
                            <span>Trà thảo mộc đón khách</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant font-body-sm text-body-sm">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-tertiary">brush</span>
                            <span>Tư vấn cắm hoa tại chỗ</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
            <!-- Showroom 2: Boutique Hanoi -->
            <article class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                <div class="p-space-lg space-y-space-md">
                    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start justify-between gap-space-sm">
                        <div>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5">
                                <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider">
                                    Boutique Store • Hà Nội
                                </span>
                                <span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-tertiary font-semibold flex items-center gap-1">
                                    <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-tertiary"></span> Mở cửa đến 21:00
                                </span>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Boutique Tràng Tiền</h3>
                            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant flex items-center gap-1.5 mt-1">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-primary">location_on</span>
                                42 Tràng Tiền, Phường Tràng Tiền, Quận Hoàn Kiếm, Hà Nội
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-surface-container hover:bg-secondary-container transition-colors text-primary font-label-lg text-label-lg shrink-0" href="tel:02439336688">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">call</span>
                            (024) 3933 6688
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Amenities -->
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-space-sm pt-space-xs">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant font-body-sm text-body-sm">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-tertiary">nest_clock_farsight_analog</span>
                            <span>Không gian trà hoa cổ điển</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant font-body-sm text-body-sm">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-tertiary">diamond</span>
                            <span>Phòng tư vấn hoa cưới &amp; sự kiện riêng tư</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
            <!-- Minimalist Map Location Preview -->
            <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-md rounded-2xl shadow-sm space-y-space-sm">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-space-xs">
                    <span class="font-title-sm text-title-sm text-on-surface flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-primary">map</span>
                        Bản đồ định vị Showroom
                    </span>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-label-md text-label-md">
                        <button class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary font-medium transition-colors" id="btn-map-sg" onclick="switchMap('sg')" type="button">Sài Gòn (Q.1)</button>
                        <button class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface font-medium transition-colors" id="btn-map-hn" onclick="switchMap('hn')" type="button">Hà Nội (Hoàn Kiếm)</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Map Container -->
                <div class="w-full h-64 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-inner bg-cover bg-center" id="map-sg" style="background-image: url('https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDwv_cFCuTPwkS9ppopW53UsXJIts-SSWzpOf074j9-g3g-5-hZVm96loU6CcIQxWhmcvyNd8lF7edXp6paC1G-FqZwLpZOntJ00k5P5ySQBKfCckCOJmOLNRh5b2zWlSsqBWNYwDccL7jGeXvpkHjsNOLcUy7EqLpNwTKMNtzaN_goArEqmlL6uF_xAm8EjwfilwIp5BP4_AmtcLtYpMPH1BbQjTxAvz0ZLq309vMaoggkazK1pUnSRA')">
                    <div class="w-full h-full bg-on-background/20 backdrop-blur-[2px] flex items-end p-space-md">
                        <div class="bg-surface/95 px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl shadow-md">
                            <p class="font-title-sm text-title-sm text-primary font-semibold">Web quản lý hoa tươi Flagship - 98 Đồng Khởi</p>
                            <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Ngay góc Đông Du &amp; Đồng Khởi, cách Nhà hát Thành phố 150m</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full h-64 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-inner bg-cover bg-center hidden" id="map-hn" style="background-image: url('https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBnN2R0wSAFG2_bT-ZaB_VU8toatf2D_iWcufx7Z-pFUytRRYeFRif-ZPoSzvPKDoLy0n4g54Rus8uMvj7Q42loJUbbdFz-rpA8-SPK5n2nwbrWovPlQrz7gz45MIy4wa33QFe6iiyoSHlXZ9SIeIRBrVXtLcPFj_ue43MhfFzlRzjvrcgbT4u1RvYgpYTt1FObdIfPurzgzYC2FBG5oKCkTCgBio15xEjfxLJW5M8vS0ULGblmpmjRcA')">
                    <div class="w-full h-full bg-on-background/20 backdrop-blur-[2px] flex items-end p-space-md">
                        <div class="bg-surface/95 px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl shadow-md">
                            <p class="font-title-sm text-title-sm text-primary font-semibold">Web quản lý hoa tươi Boutique - 42 Tràng Tiền</p>
                            <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Gần Nhà hát Lớn Hà Nội &amp; Hồ Hoàn Kiếm</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Column: Interactive Consultation & Request Form (5 cols) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg md:p-space-xl rounded-2xl shadow-lg sticky top-32">
            <div class="space-y-space-xs mb-space-lg">
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">edit_note</span>
                    LẮNG NGHE TẬN TÂM
                </span>
                <h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface">Gửi Lời Nhắn Đến Chúng Tôi</h2>
                <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
                    Hãy để lại thông tin, Florist phụ trách sẽ liên hệ lại với bạn trong vòng 30 phút để lên phác thảo ý tưởng hoàn hảo nhất.
                </p>
            </div>
            <form class="space-y-space-md" id="contact-form" onsubmit="handleFormSubmit(event)">
                <!-- Name -->
                <div>
                    <label class="block font-title-sm text-title-sm text-on-surface mb-1" for="fullname">
                        Họ và tên <span class="text-primary">*</span>
                    </label>
                    <input class="w-full px-space-md py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface placeholder:text-outline focus:outline-none focus:bg-surface-container-lowest transition-all" id="fullname" placeholder="Ví dụ: Nguyễn Phương Anh" required="" type="text">
                </div>
                <!-- Phone / Zalo -->
                <div>
                    <label class="block font-title-sm text-title-sm text-on-surface mb-1" for="phone">
                        Số điện thoại / Zalo <span class="text-primary">*</span>
                    </label>
                    <input class="w-full px-space-md py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface placeholder:text-outline focus:outline-none focus:bg-surface-container-lowest transition-all" id="phone" placeholder="Ví dụ: 0918 345 678" required="" type="tel">
                </div>
                <!-- Email -->
                <div>
                    <label class="block font-title-sm text-title-sm text-on-surface mb-1" for="email">
                        Địa chỉ Email
                    </label>
                    <input class="w-full px-space-md py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface placeholder:text-outline focus:outline-none focus:bg-surface-container-lowest transition-all" id="email" placeholder="name@domain.com" type="email">
                </div>
                <!-- Service Dropdown -->
                <div>
                    <label class="block font-title-sm text-title-sm text-on-surface mb-1" for="service">
                        Dịch vụ bạn quan tâm
                    </label>
                    <select class="w-full px-space-md py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface focus:outline-none focus:bg-surface-container-lowest transition-all cursor-pointer" id="service">
                        <option value="mau-san">Đặt hoa theo mẫu có sẵn (Catalog)</option>
                        <option value="thiet-ke-rieng">Thiết kế hoa độc bản theo yêu cầu (Bespoke)</option>
                        <option value="su-kien-b2b">Hoa sự kiện doanh nghiệp &amp; Khai trương (B2B)</option>
                        <option value="hoa-cuoi">Hoa cưới trọn gói &amp; Tiệc cưới Luxury</option>
                        <option value="workshop">Workshop cắm hoa nghệ thuật cuối tuần</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
                <!-- Showroom Preference Radio -->
                <div class="space-y-1.5">
                    <span class="block font-title-sm text-title-sm text-on-surface">Showroom mong muốn tư vấn</span>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2">
                        <label class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container cursor-pointer transition-colors text-on-surface">
                            <input checked="" class="accent-primary" name="showroom" type="radio" value="saigon">
                            <span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm">Sài Gòn - Q.1</span>
                        </label>
                        <label class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container cursor-pointer transition-colors text-on-surface">
                            <input class="accent-primary" name="showroom" type="radio" value="hanoi">
                            <span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm">Hà Nội - HK</span>
                        </label>
                        <label class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container cursor-pointer transition-colors text-on-surface">
                            <input class="accent-primary" name="showroom" type="radio" value="online">
                            <span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm">Online Zalo</span>
                        </label>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Custom Request / Notes -->
                <div>
                    <label class="block font-title-sm text-title-sm text-on-surface mb-1" for="message">
                        Lời nhắn hoặc yêu cầu chi tiết
                    </label>
                    <textarea class="w-full px-space-md py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface placeholder:text-outline focus:outline-none focus:bg-surface-container-lowest transition-all" id="message" placeholder="Chia sẻ về tone màu mong muốn, loài hoa yêu thích, ngân sách dự kiến hoặc thời gian nhận hoa..." rows="3"></textarea>
                </div>
                <!-- Bespoke Preference Checkbox -->
                <div class="p-space-sm bg-surface-container-low/60 rounded-lg">
                    <label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 cursor-pointer">
                        <input checked="" class="mt-1 accent-primary rounded" id="send-zalo" type="checkbox">
                        <span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-snug">
                            Tôi muốn nhận phác thảo mẫu hoa và bảng báo giá chi tiết qua số Zalo đã cung cấp.
                        </span>
                    </label>
                </div>
                <!-- Submit Button -->
                <button class="w-full py-3.5 px-space-lg rounded-full bg-primary hover:bg-primary-container text-on-primary font-title-sm text-title-sm transition-all duration-300 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg active:scale-[0.99]" type="submit">
                    <span>Gửi Lời Nhắn Ngay</span>
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">arrow_forward</span>
                </button>
                <!-- Trust Badges & Guarantee -->
